WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
A stunt performer steps off a
platform, high above the ground,

2
00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.780
and drops feet first.

3
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.820
Below waits a huge air-filled bag.

4
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:12.570
They sink deep into it,
roll off, and walk away.

5
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.560
The same fall onto bare
concrete would kill.

6
00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.850
Same performer, same drop.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.580
So why is one landing deadly,
and the other harmless?

8
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.970
In this mission, you'll see
how a force changes momentum,

9
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.520
and meet a quantity called impulse.

10
00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:31.670
Then you'll bounce a ball off a wall,
and calculate the force the wall exerts

11
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.550
on it.

12
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:36.460
Your mission: explain why the
performer walks away from the airbag,

13
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.190
but not from concrete.
